<title>GERMANY: German productivity up 2.5 pct in 96 - stats office.</title>
<headline>German productivity up 2.5 pct in 96 - stats office.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>German productivity grew 2.5 percent in 1996, an official for the German Federal Statistics Office told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
